                                        </div>
                                        <div class="ielts-reading-questions">
                                                                                                                                                                                                <div class="ielts-reading-question-item"> • <span>If there are any trend-related changes impacting on your category, you should</span><span class="ielts-inline-select-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">38</strong><select data-qnum="38" name="question_38" class="ielts-inline-select"><option value="">[ 38 ] Tanlang...</option><option value="A. employ a combination of strategies to maintain your consumer base.">A. employ a combination of strategies to maintain your consumer base.</option><option value="B. identify the most appropriate innovation strategy to use.">B. identify the most appropriate innovation strategy to use.</option><option value="C. emphasise your brand’s traditional values with the counteract-and-affirm strategy.">C. emphasise your brand’s traditional values with the counteract-and-affirm strategy.</option><option value="D. use the combine-and-transcend strategy to integrate the two worlds.">D. use the combine-and-transcend strategy to integrate the two worlds.</option></select></span></div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    <div class="ielts-reading-question-item"> • <span>If a current trend highlights a negative aspect of your category, you should</span><span class="ielts-inline-select-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">39</strong><select data-qnum="39" name="question_39" class="ielts-inline-select"><option value="">[ 39 ] Tanlang...</option><option value="A. employ a combination of strategies to maintain your consumer base.">A. employ a combination of strategies to maintain your consumer base.</option><option value="B. identify the most appropriate innovation strategy to use.">B. identify the most appropriate innovation strategy to use.</option><option value="C. emphasise your brand’s traditional values with the counteract-and-affirm strategy.">C. emphasise your brand’s traditional values with the counteract-and-affirm strategy.</option><option value="D. use the combine-and-transcend strategy to integrate the two worlds.">D. use the combine-and-transcend strategy to integrate the two worlds.</option></select></span></div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    <div class="ielts-reading-question-item"> • <span>If the consumers’ new focus has an increasing lack of connection with your offering you should</span><span class="ielts-inline-select-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">40</strong><select data-qnum="40" name="question_40" class="ielts-inline-select"><option value="">[ 40 ] Tanlang...</option><option value="A. employ a combination of strategies to maintain your consumer base.">A. employ a combination of strategies to maintain your consumer base.</option><option value="B. identify the most appropriate innovation strategy to use.">B. identify the most appropriate innovation strategy to use.</option><option value="C. emphasise your brand’s traditional values with the counteract-and-affirm strategy.">C. emphasise your brand’s traditional values with the counteract-and-affirm strategy.</option><option value="D. use the combine-and-transcend strategy to integrate the two worlds.">D. use the combine-and-transcend strategy to integrate the two worlds.</option></select></span></div>                                                                        <div class="options-dnd-panel dnd-panel" data-dnd-group="9476">
                                                                            <div class="dnd-panel-instruction">Drag and drop an option to fill in each blank.</div>
                                                                            <div class="dnd-cards-container">
                                                                                                                                                                    <div class="dnd-card" draggable="true" data-value="A" data-text="A. employ a combination of strategies to maintain your consumer base.">
                                                                                        <span class="dnd-label">A.</span>
                                                                                        <span class="dnd-text">employ a combination of strategies to maintain your consumer base.</span>
                                                                                    </div>
                                                                                                                                                                    <div class="dnd-card" draggable="true" data-value="B" data-text="B. identify the most appropriate innovation strategy to use.">
                                                                                        <span class="dnd-label">B.</span>
                                                                                        <span class="dnd-text">identify the most appropriate innovation strategy to use.</span>
                                                                                    </div>
                                                                                                                                                                    <div class="dnd-card" draggable="true" data-value="C" data-text="C. emphasise your brand’s traditional values with the counteract-and-affirm strategy.">
                                                                                        <span class="dnd-label">C.</span>
                                                                                        <span class="dnd-text">emphasise your brand’s traditional values with the counteract-and-affirm strategy.</span>
                                                                                    </div>
                                                                                                                                                                    <div class="dnd-card" draggable="true" data-value="D" data-text="D. use the combine-and-transcend strategy to integrate the two worlds.">
                                                                                        <span class="dnd-label">D.</span>
