                                            <div class="ielts-reading-section-content-wrapper"><p>Complete the summary using the list of words <strong>A-G</strong> below.</p>
<p>Write the correct letter, <strong>A-G</strong>, in boxes on your answer sheet.</p>
<p><strong>Jeremy Bentham</strong></p>
<p>Jeremy Bentham was active in other areas besides philosophy. In the 1970s he suggested a type of technology to improve <span class="ielts-reading-question-item"><span class="ielts-inline-select-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">30</strong><select data-qnum="30" name="question_30" class="ielts-inline-select"><option value="">[ 30 ] Tanlang...</option><option value="A. measurement">A. measurement</option><option value="B. security">B. security</option><option value="C. implementation">C. implementation</option><option value="D. profits">D. profits</option><option value="E. observation">E. observation</option><option value="F. communication">F. communication</option><option value="G. preservation">G. preservation</option></select></span></span> for different Government departments. He developed a new way of printing banknotes to increase <span class="ielts-reading-question-item"><span class="ielts-inline-select-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">31</strong><select data-qnum="31" name="question_31" class="ielts-inline-select"><option value="">[ 31 ] Tanlang...</option><option value="A. measurement">A. measurement</option><option value="B. security">B. security</option><option value="C. implementation">C. implementation</option><option value="D. profits">D. profits</option><option value="E. observation">E. observation</option><option value="F. communication">F. communication</option><option value="G. preservation">G. preservation</option></select></span></span> and also designed a method for the <span class="ielts-reading-question-item"><span class="ielts-inline-select-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">32</strong><select data-qnum="32" name="question_32" class="ielts-inline-select"><option value="">[ 32 ] Tanlang...</option><option value="A. measurement">A. measurement</option><option value="B. security">B. security</option><option value="C. implementation">C. implementation</option><option value="D. profits">D. profits</option><option value="E. observation">E. observation</option><option value="F. communication">F. communication</option><option value="G. preservation">G. preservation</option></select></span></span> of food. He also drew up plans for a prison which allowed the <span class="ielts-reading-question-item"><span class="ielts-inline-select-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">33</strong><select data-qnum="33" name="question_33" class="ielts-inline-select"><option value="">[ 33 ] Tanlang...</option><option value="A. measurement">A. measurement</option><option value="B. security">B. security</option><option value="C. implementation">C. implementation</option><option value="D. profits">D. profits</option><option value="E. observation">E. observation</option><option value="F. communication">F. communication</option><option value="G. preservation">G. preservation</option></select></span></span> of prisoners at al times, and believed the same design could be used for other institutions as well. When researching happiness, he investigated possibilities for its <span class="ielts-reading-question-item"><span class="ielts-inline-select-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">34</strong><select data-qnum="34" name="question_34" class="ielts-inline-select"><option value="">[ 34 ] Tanlang...</option><option value="A. measurement">A. measurement</option><option value="B. security">B. security</option><option value="C. implementation">C. implementation</option><option value="D. profits">D. profits</option><option value="E. observation">E. observation</option><option value="F. communication">F. communication</option><option value="G. preservation">G. preservation</option></select></span></span>, and suggested some methods of doing this.</p>
